find: const SHARE: f64 = 0.8;
replace: const SHARE: f64 = 1.0;
caught-by:
    watch::tests::the_report_comes_before_the_limit

[break] watch-misreads-the-process-start
rule: On Linux the time is counted from the process's start.
file: crates/cineris-testkit/src/watch.rs
in: process_age
find: after.split_whitespace().nth(19)
replace: after.split_whitespace().nth(18)
caught-by:
    watch::tests::the_age_of_this_process_is_read_on_linux

